  "id": "flood/flood-storage-areas",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Flood Storage Areas show those areas that act as a balancing reservoir, storage basin or balancing pond. Their purpose is to attenuate an incoming flood peak to a flow level that can be accepted by the downstream channel. It may also delay the timing of a flood peak so that its volume is discharged over a longer time interval.\n\nFlood Storage Areas that are not yet shown will be gradually added as information becomes available.\n\nAttribution Statement\n\nContains Natural Resources Wales information \u00a9 Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.",
